troparia.text:
Enthroned on high with the Eternal Father and Thy divine Spirit,
O Jesus, Thou didst will to be born on earth of the unwedded handmaid, thy Mother.
Therefore, Thou wast circumcised as an eight-day-old Child.
Glory to Thy most gracious counsel;
glory to Thy dispensation;
glory to Thy condescension, O only Lover of mankind.
